# CampusNow mobile configuration — public values only.
#
# Everything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is compiled into the app bundle and is
# therefore visible to anyone with the app. No secret, credential or private
# key may ever be placed here: privileged values live on the backend
# (see backend/.env.example).

# Base URL of the campus backend. Leave unset to run entirely offline: reports
# are then saved on the device and clearly marked as not sent.
#
#   Android emulator on the same machine : http://10.0.2.2:8000
#   iOS simulator                        : http://localhost:8000
#   A physical phone                     : http://<your-computer-lan-ip>:8000
#   Production                           : https://api.campus.example.edu
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
